sequenceDiagram
 participant B as React
 participant A as FastAPI
 participant S as security + auth.py
 participant D as PostgreSQL
 B->>A: POST /auth/login
 A->>D: find user
 A->>S: verify hash + create JWT
 A->>D: INSERT AuthSession
 A-->>B: token + user
 B->>A: GET /users/me + Bearer
 A->>S: verify claims/session
 S->>D: get session/user
 A-->>B: UserPublic
 B->>A: POST /auth/logout
 A->>D: DELETE session
 A-->>B: 204
